WEBVTT

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:44.960
(McQUEEN EXHALES)

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.080
McQUEEN: Okay, here we go.

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.040
Focus. Speed. I am speed.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.320
(ENGINES ROARING)

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:58.040
One winner, 42 losers.
I eat losers for breakfast.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:01.800
Did I used to say that?

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:03.800
-MATER: Yes, sir, you did.
-(McQUEEN GASPS)

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:07.680
-You used to say that all the time.
-Mater, what are you doing in here?

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:09.840
Well, I didn't want you to be lonely.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.320
(STUTTERS) Thank you.
But I'm kind of preparing for a race.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.360
I need a little quiet.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.400
Oh, right. You got it, buddy.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.880
Hey, everybody, listen up.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:25.520
My best friend, Lightning McQueen,
needs quiet. (SHOUTING) Perfect quiet!

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:27.080
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:28.960
Okay. Where was I?

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:30.560
(EXHALES DEEPLY)

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:33.480
Racing. Real racing.

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:35.160
(SCOFFS)

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.360
That ain't racing.
That wasn't even a Sunday drive.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:39.640
That was one lap.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:42.960
Racing is 500 of those.
Everybody fighting to move up.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:47.120
Lap after lap. Inside, outside,
inches apart. Never touching.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.680
Now that's racing.

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:52.880
(CHUCKLES) Well, I can't argue
with The Doc Hudson.

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.360
(CHUCKLES) How true, how true.

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:56.520
(LAUGHS)

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:58.120
-(BANGS ON DOOR)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.360
MACK: Hey, Lightning, you ready?

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:01.880
Oh, yeah. Lightning's ready.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.360
(ENGINE REVVING)

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:06.840
This one's for you, Doc.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:11.480
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:27.320
Whoo-hoo! Come on, Stickers.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.560
Pardon me. Excuse me.
Best friend coming through.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:31.600
Go, McQueen! Whoo-hoo!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.280
-CAR: Pass him now, 24!
-Lightning McQueen!

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:36.920
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.880
Go, 95! (HORN HONKS)

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:41.160
Whoo-hoo!

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.000
Hey, Cal, your blinker's on.

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:47.960
What? No, it's not.
Hey! Your blinker's on.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.240
Good comeback, Cal.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:53.360
♪ Because I want to run that race

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:57.040
♪ I want to run that race

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.720
♪ I do it at my pace

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.760
♪ Long as I get to run that race ♪

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:06.400
CUTLASS: Into the pit goes
Lightning McQueen,

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:07.760
Bobby Swift and Cal Weathers.

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:10.080
These three are fun to watch,
aren't they, Darrell?

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:13.000
You know, Bob, I can't tell
if they have more fun on or off the track.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:14.280
(WHIRRING)

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.120
Finito! (SPEAKS ITALIAN) Mmm.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.480
You getting a car wash too, Cal?

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:22.280
No, you're getting a car wash, McQueen.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:23.560
Good comeback, Cal.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.680
♪ We gotta run that race

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:30.080
♪ We gotta run that race

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:33.600
♪ We do it at our pace

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:38.000
♪ Long as we get to run that race
Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:41.680
Lightning, how do you keep your focus
racing against Bobby and Cal?

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.840
I think the key is we respect each other.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.760
These guys are real class acts--

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:46.960
(LAUGHTER)

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.880
BOBBY: Congratulations, cupcake.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.600
Oh, they are gonna pay.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.320
-(CHEERING)
-CAR: Go, Dinoco!

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.680
Great win today, Cal.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:06.400
Thank you, Shannon.
It was a great boost and I was--

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.840
-Hey! Hey! Guido!
-(LAUGHTER)

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:10.120
Pit stop.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.200
Ha, ha. Laugh it up. Real funny.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:14.800
-(ALL LAUGHING)
-(TIRE HISSING)

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:20.640
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:22.000
Keep it going, buddy!

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:27.520
McQUEEN: Whoo!

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:34.120
(CHUCKLES) Hey!
Are my sponsors happy today?

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:35.640
Stop winning
for crying out loud.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:37.560
We're running out
of bumper cream to sell.

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.600
-(ALL LAUGHING)
-Lightning McQueen!

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:42.240
Hey, Big Tex.
How's my favorite competitor?

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:45.200
Just say the word and...
I'll boot Cal off the Dinoco team

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:46.400
and replace him with you.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:49.160
You know I can hear you, right?
I'm right here.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:52.760
Bye, Cal. See you next week. Or not.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:55.240
Oh, come on now. I'm joking.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:59.720
Go, little buddy! Whoo-hoo!
And big buddy too!

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:01.200
(ENGINES ROARING)

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.200
CUTLASS: Another great finish
in the making.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.560
McQueen and Swift nose to nose.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.560
How's the view back there, Bobby?

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:10.760
(SCOFFS) Well, you better not blink.

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.120
I'll blow right past you.

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:13.640
CUTLASS: The flag is out.

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.880
It's the final stretch.
McQueen in the lead.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.760
-Okay, let's see what you got.
-Whoo-whee!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.920
(CAR ACCELERATING)

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:29.720
DARRELL: Holy cow!
CUTLASS: Whoa!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.400
It's Jackson Storm for the win.
A huge upset!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.520
DARRELL: Neither Lightning nor
Bobby ever saw him coming.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:37.520
ANNOUNCER ON PA:
It's one thing to start fast,

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.720
but we haven't seen
anyone cross the line...

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.880
with that kind of speed
and power since a young...

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:45.080
Lightning McQueen
first arrived on the scene.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:49.760
-McQUEEN: Hey, Bobby? Who is that?
-That's, um, Jackson Storm.

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:51.320
Yeah. He's one of the rookies.

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:52.400
(CAMERAS SNAPPING)

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:53.480
Huh.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:55.920
-(REPORTERS CLAMORING)
-Thank you, guys. Thank you.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.160
No, I appreciate it.
Thank you very much.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:03.120
Hey. Jackson Storm, right?
Great race today.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.920
Wow! Thank you, Mr. McQueen.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:08.480
You have no idea what a pleasure it is
for me to finally beat you.

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:13.440
Oh, thanks. Wait. (CHUCKLES)
Hang on. Did you say "meet" or "beat"?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.240
-I think you heard me.
-Uh, what?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.720
REPORTER: Storm,
can we get some pictures?

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.480
Yeah, yeah. Come on.
Let's get a picture. You know what?

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:22.560
Get a ton of pictures
because champ here

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:25.400
has been a role model of mine...
for years now.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.560
And I mean a lot of years.
Right? I love this guy.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:33.880
REPORTER: Storm, give us a quote.
What's your top speed?

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.760
I think I touched a nerve.

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.120
(TECHNO MUSIC PLAYING)

